<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-23T13:39:58.758Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:39:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli forces fired across the border into southern Syria, killing a Syrian man with disabilities in the Daraa buffer zone and deploying rooftop snipers who opened fire in the south. Syrian security officers were killed in a raid on an ISIL cell near Damascus. In a separate operation, Syrian forces targeted an ISIS cell in Rankous, resulting in the deaths of two Syrian security personnel. The conflict continued to involve cross-border Israeli strikes and Syrian government counter-terror actions. The war caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFByX3hUSmJucGdmRFU0SlB0QVMxRElTeVotWVJKTGNUcEMwbHZHMzZobklOTTdBVGtiT2s1Z1BCOUtRRDJpbEFEMg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/two-syrian-security-officers-killed-in-raid-on-isil-cell-near-damascus&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news-analysis/2026/10/22/ilhan-omar-home-raid-haines-attack-inside-rise-in-violence-on-officials&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Harici&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQQ1R2WFBpWk5CMjZXZV9fY3M0MFA2MTQwemFUMWVXWEZtbmdnUHJjZ2ZzZ3NrSTNkR1pQRUdiSkxtVWZEdkdSV1prQWk5am9RU2V5dldQbEE2WnJybUZoRzk3c2wyOF9oclFsSHdwUjh0al85X3ExV0hwY21JRzNPWVl2YTFaNGhfQ0RoRDF1RE1BRmZiU3lHN21QRVpleWd2dTRWUWZZNEl5LURQczNtSGhTX1ZNR0hqMzFVVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AsiaNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNRVNtejRYQlBMNjVyT0dQdklXT3hQUWRFWno5eFRqaV9BMU1HNGNCanU0V0VvYTBKMFNsMTJ3Rjl0czZTS3BYTF